ent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "docker push \"${DockerHubUser}/memory-game6085:1.0.0\"", "style": "Normal", "font": "Consolas", "size": "9pt", "color": "000000", "spaceAfter": "2pt", "lineSpacing": "1.15x", "font.ea": "宋体", "keepLines": "true"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "docker pull \"${DockerHubUser}/memory-game6085:1.0.0\"", "style": "Normal", "font": "Consolas", "size": "9pt", "color": "000000", "spaceAfter": "2pt", "lineSpacing": "1.15x", "font.ea": "宋体", "keepLines": "true"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "docker image ls", "style": "Normal", "font": "Consolas", "size": "9pt", "color": "000000", "spaceAfter": "2pt", "lineSpacing": "1.15x", "font.ea": "宋体", "keepLines": "true"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "需补充推送成功及拉取成功的真实终端截图，并验证拉取后的镜像可以启动并访问。若本机已有镜像，拉取可能复用已有层；需如实描述，不能写为重新下载了所有镜像层。", "style": "Normal", "font": "宋体", "size": "11pt", "color": "000000", "spaceAfter": "7pt", "lineSpacing": "1.3x"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "七 数据持久化验证", "style": "Heading1", "font": "黑体", "size": "18pt", "color": "000000", "spaceAfter": "10pt", "lineSpacing": "1.3x", "bold": "true", "spaceBefore": "12pt", "keepNext": "true", "pageBreakBefore": "false"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "7.1 已完成的本地服务重启验证", "style": "Heading2", "font": "黑体", "size": "14pt", "color": "000000", "spaceAfter": "10pt", "lineSpacing": "1.3x", "bold": "true", "spaceBefore": "12pt", "keepNext": "true", "pageBreakBefore": "false"}}, {"command": "add", "parent": "/body", "type": "paragraph", "props": {"text": "在独立测试实例中完成游戏并提交成绩，读取轻松难度排行榜；停止该 Java 服务，再使用相同数据库目录启动，重新读取榜单。已对比重启前后的完整榜单内容，结果一致。这验证了 SQLite 成绩文件可以跨应用进程重启保留。", "style": "Normal", "font": "宋体", "size": "11pt", "color": "000000", "spaceAfter": "7pt", "lineSpacing": "1.3x"}}, {"command": "a